  "details": "Description\n\nWhile moving my mouse diagonally (pc of course) my view jitters really badly, and is worse with lower framerate.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nIts always active, cant seem to get it to stop. Any dpi or framerate seems to do it, and higher framerate (above 60) seems to make it slightly less noticable\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p1-1902-20253ca7ae-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
